# A LOCK OVER THE SHOULDER WITH PEOPLE ABOUT (teammate1, 2026-09-24: two
# villagers covering the right third of a locked view). Somebody who walks
# between the eye and the locked machine is looked over: the view tips down and
# the eye rises over their head, eased, while the machine stays framed; once
# they have passed it settles back. Staged in a village with people out, and the
# tour waits for a villager to cross the line rather than placing one there.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lockon_crowd.tour --seed=4 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --folk=14
coast calm
village 0
wait 1.5
tap shoulder
await shoulder 3
spawn cutter
wait 0.8
hold target
await target:cutter 5
await shoulder_locked 3
wait 0.5
shot 01-locked-with-people-about with shoulder_locked,mob:cutter,folk

try 16
walk 1,0 0.3
await person_on_line 0.3
end
shot 02-a-villager-steps-onto-the-line with person_on_line,shoulder_locked,folk
wait 1.0
shot 03-looked-over-them with shoulder_clearing,shoulder_locked,folk

release target
await target_none 5
